        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Dog breeds: Sporting Lucas Terrier, Elkhound\n- Dog breed groups: Fennoscadian dog breeds\n- Concepts: larger relatives, breed naming, hunting dogs\n- Animals: elk, moose, bears\n\nFacts:\n- The Sporting Lucas Terrier has larger relatives that are not named after a particular person.\n- The Elkhound belongs to a group of Fennoscadian dog breeds.\n- Fennoscadian dog breeds include dogs used for hunting elk, moose, and bears.\n- The larger relatives of the Sporting Lucas Terrier and the Elkhound are not named after a particular person.",
